; The XPLM functions the plugin calls (live_gate.c declares them, so the SDK is not needed). The
; Windows build makes its import library from them: X-Plane gives them from
; Resources/plugins/XPLM_64.dll. The Mac's makes its stub of X-Plane's XPLM framework from them
; (orthostudio/live/plugin.py).
LIBRARY XPLM_64.dll
EXPORTS
    XPLMDebugString
    XPLMEnableFeature
    XPLMFindDataRef
    XPLMGetDatad
    XPLMGetSystemPath
    XPLMRegisterFlightLoopCallback
    XPLMUnregisterFlightLoopCallback
